    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the number of point(s) where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is non-differentiable is/are"
